DOCS/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Tests and CI — not needed at runtime
tests/
pytest.ini
.github/

# Audit and deployment docs
AUDIT_REPORT.md
DEPLOYMENT.md
INTERVIEW_GUIDE.md

# Local demo artefacts
#
# .qdrant_local/ used to be excluded here unconditionally. The repo-root
# Dockerfile (Gemini/Cloud-Run path) never used it — Qdrant Cloud instead —
# so excluding it was harmless there. But deploy/gcp/Dockerfile and
# deploy/render/Dockerfile both intentionally COPY a pre-populated
# .qdrant_local/ into the image (the embedded-Qdrant baked-index pattern, see
# DEPLOYMENT_REPORT.md), and both build with dockerContext "." — the repo
# root — so this file's exclusions apply to them too. Excluding it here broke
# that build with "COPY .qdrant_local/ ./.qdrant_local/: not found" even after
# force-adding the directory to git. Not excluded any more; the only cost is
# it enters the build context, which is 1.4 MB.
scripts/
DEMO.md
